..\POINTS\UNI00.RAW:	..\POINTS\UNI00.TXT CARTDEFS.INC
		ECHO Updating UNI??.RAW and UNI??.WLD files...
		CD ..\POINTS
		GW
		CD ..\SOURCE

COMPLETE.ASM:	COMPLETE.DNL
		ECHO Updating COMPLETE.ASM...
		DATA2ASM <COMPLETE.DNL >COMPLETE.ASM

